{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/6ff0a7be473103e4d5b078c4f4f07148.avif?t=1770557828\" width=864 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dino Domino is a <strong>pixel-art puzzle</strong> game mixing <strong>pseudo-programming</strong> with<strong> turn-based battles</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/5d67cc5a363a1fffa1a2334a147befd8.avif?t=1770557828\" width=882 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looks like a simple turn-based puzzle game: control a little dinosaur to defeat enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/37548da0853aead82389f96b3ddac41e.poster.avif?t=1770557828\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/37548da0853aead82389f96b3ddac41e.webm?t=1770557828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/37548da0853aead82389f96b3ddac41e.mp4?t=1770557828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the real gameplay is: you can open the game's &quot;backend console&quot;, swap command modules, and directly rewrite the rules: make fireballs heal, make enemies explode, create chain reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example: Want the enemy's claw attack ability? Drag its [Claw Attack] command onto your [Spacebar]. Now, you can claw attack by pressing spacebar!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/af3e1bdc00675299dce82d5d1bfe3560.poster.avif?t=1770557828\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/af3e1bdc00675299dce82d5d1bfe3560.webm?t=1770557828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/af3e1bdc00675299dce82d5d1bfe3560.mp4?t=1770557828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get even crazier! Change the result of [Hit by Fireball] from [Death] to [Heal]. Now getting hit by a fireball will restore your health instead!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/a2809e5726701e5456ff8a400afe6957.poster.avif?t=1770557828\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/a2809e5726701e5456ff8a400afe6957.webm?t=1770557828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/a2809e5726701e5456ff8a400afe6957.mp4?t=1770557828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more interesting and subversive gameplay awaits your discovery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/be52731de5a433a7f9b25b7e18cd04f8.avif?t=1770557828\" width=882 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ handcrafted levels with new mechanics and challenges across 10+ chapters. Welcome to the world of Dino Domino!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm porridge, independently developing this game. If you're interested, welcome to add it to your wishlist/join the playtest. Thank you for your support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921050?t=1770557828","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921050?t=1770557828","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/3ca6f98fbf312770bcec3b4645eda99d84377297/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770557828","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/3ca6f98fbf312770bcec3b4645eda99d84377297/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770557828","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/6ff0a7be473103e4d5b078c4f4f07148.avif?t=1770557828\" width=864 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dino Domino is a <strong>pixel-art puzzle</strong> game mixing <strong>pseudo-programming</strong> with<strong> turn-based battles</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/5d67cc5a363a1fffa1a2334a147befd8.avif?t=1770557828\" width=882 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looks like a simple turn-based puzzle game: control a lit