y Fireball] from [Death] to [Heal]. Now getting hit by a fireball will restore your health instead!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/a2809e5726701e5456ff8a400afe6957.poster.avif?t=1770557828\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/a2809e5726701e5456ff8a400afe6957.webm?t=1770557828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/a2809e5726701e5456ff8a400afe6957.mp4?t=1770557828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more interesting and subversive gameplay awaits your discovery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/be52731de5a433a7f9b25b7e18cd04f8.avif?t=1770557828\" width=882 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ handcrafted levels with new mechanics and challenges across 10+ chapters. Welcome to the world of Dino Domino!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm porridge, independently developing this game. If you're interested, welcome to add it to your wishlist/join the playtest. Thank you for your support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Porridge"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/d0e52aa67b0cfea835c5af807671411d6c53bf1e/header.jpg?t=1770557828","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Mini